#+ Book 1 intro
#@{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_intro_cutscene01"
	val[]: "Welcome to @@driving_academy@@."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_intro_cutscene02"
	val[]: "The following scenarios represent the first step on your journey to professional truck driving."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_intro_cutscene03"
	val[]: "Here, you'll learn everything from the basic systems and controls of the truck..."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_intro_cutscene04"
	val[]: "...to complex manoeuvres both with and without a trailer."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_intro_cutscene05"
	val[]: "We'll help to instil habits that will help you to safely navigate a variety of situations,"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_intro_cutscene06"
	val[]: "and teach you to make wise use of the space available to effectively manoeuvre your truck."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_intro_cutscene07"
	val[]: "By completing all the scenarios and passing the final exams,"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_intro_cutscene08"
	val[]: "you'll be ready to hit the roads of Europe and find new challenges to face."

#@}

