#+ Book 1 Scenario 1_05
#@{

#### 1_05 common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_1_05_title"
	val[]: "Lights and Wipers"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_1_05_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll explore some of the truck's basic controls that help to maintain a clear view of your surroundings and make your driving predictable for other road users.<br><br>You'll learn to use windscreen wipers to maintain good visibility in bad weather as well as the controls for lights and turn signals."

#### 1_05 goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_1_05_start"
	val[]: "Starting the Engine"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_1_05_parking"
	val[]: "Parking Lights"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_1_05_low_beam"
	val[]: "Low Beam Lights"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_1_05_high_beam"
	val[]: "High Beam Lights"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_1_05_lblinkers"
	val[]: "Left Turn Signal"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_1_05_rblinkers"
	val[]: "Right Turn Signal"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_1_05_hazard"
	val[]: "Hazard Lights"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_1_05_wipers"
	val[]: "Windscreen Wipers"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_1_05_end"
	val[]: "Turning off the Engine"

#### 1_05 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_cutscene1"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll go over some of the truck's features that will ensure that you can see and be seen at the same time."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_cutscene2"
	val[]: "We'll activate the various lighting systems and learn when it is necessary to use each of them."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_cutscene3"
	val[]: "We'll operate the left and right turn signals."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_cutscene4"
	val[]: "And finally, we'll go over how to adjust the wipers to ensure they function effectively in varying levels of precipitation."



#### 1_05 Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_start"
	val[]: "Let's go over how to use various types of lights, as well as how to control the windscreen wipers.<br><br>Low beam and high beam headlights ensure a good view of the road ahead. Turn signals and hazard lights are used so that other road users can anticipate your manoeuvres.<br><br>Wipers are used to keep the windscreen clear of water and other debris.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Start the engine, but do not release the parking brake. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_parking"
	val[]: "So far, you have only been using daytime running lights. They automatically activate when the ignition is turned on and are used for better visibility of the vehicle under normal conditions. However, now that conditions have worsened, you will need to use the full lighting system.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Press @@imv_nrm_light@@ to turn on the parking lights. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_low_beam"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_1_05_low_beam_img@@<br>Parking lights illuminate the front, side and rear marker lights. They're used when you are parked in poor lighting conditions so that you are visible to other drivers.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Press @@imv_nrm_light@@ to switch to low beam headlights. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_high_beam_on"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_1_05_high_beam_on_img@@<br>Low beam headlights illuminate the road ahead of you and also improve the visibility of your vehicle in poor lighting conditions.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Use @@imv_nrm_hblight@@ to switch to high beam headlights. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_high_beam_off"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_1_05_high_beam_off_img@@<br>High beam headlights allow you to see further down the road in poor lighting conditions.<br><br>Be mindful when using them, though, as they can dazzle other road users, especially those in oncoming traffic. Be sure to turn your high beams off as you approach other drivers.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Use @@imv_nrm_hblight@@ to turn the high beam headlights off. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_lblinker_on"
	val[]: "Now, let's look at the turn signals. The function of turn signals is to provide a visual signal to other road users about a lane change or a change in direction.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Press @@imv_nrm_lblinker@@ to activate the left turn signal. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_lblinker_off"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_1_05_lblinker_off_img@@<br>You'll notice that the left signal light indicator is flashing on the dashboard. The left turn signals are also flashing on the left side of the truck.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Now press @@imv_nrm_lblinker@@ to turn off the left turn signal. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_rblinker_on"
	val[]: "Signals indicating a change in direction should be given in a timely manner, so that other road users have time to anticipate your manoeuvre and adjust their driving accordingly.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Press @@imv_nrm_rblinker@@ to activate the right turn signal. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_rblinker_off"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_1_05_rblinker_off_img@@<br>On the dashboard, the right signal light indicator is now flashing. At the same time, the turn signals are flashing on the right side of the truck.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Now press @@imv_nrm_rblinker@@ to turn off the right turn signal. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_hazard_on"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_1_05_hazard_on_img@@<br>The hazard light switch is indicated by a red, triangle-shaped logo. These lights are an important part of road safety and should only be used when necessary. This function activates both the left and right turn signals simultaneously.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Press @@imv_nrm_flasher4way@@ to turn on the hazard lights.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_hazard_off"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_1_05_hazard_off_img@@<br>Both turn signal indicators are now flashing, indicating that the hazard lights are on. At the same time, the turn signals are flashing on both sides of the truck.<br><br>Hazard lights are typically used when the truck is stopped in a place where it normally wouldn't be, such as the side of the road because of a technical or mechanical issue. They can also be used to warn drivers behind you of stopped traffic ahead.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Now, press @@imv_nrm_flasher4way@@ to turn off the hazard lights. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_wipers_on"
	val[]: "Now, let's move on to the windscreen wipers. Windscreen wipers are used to remove rain and other debris from the vehicle's windscreen. Their main function is to keep the windscreen clean and clear. Wipers have several speed settings.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Press @@imv_nrm_wipers@@ to set the windscreen wipers to the intermittent setting. </font>@@aca_goal_tip@@ In the Career, you can use the rain sensor to automatically engage the windscreen wipers when it's raining. You can find the @@rain_sensor@@ settings in the Options Screen - 'Gameplay'."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_wipers2"
	val[]: "This setting allows for the wipers to periodically activate. This is useful when precipitation is very light.<br><br>As you can see, the rain is too heavy, and the wipers are unable to keep up with the amount of rain falling on the windscreen.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Press @@imv_nrm_wipers@@ again to switch the windscreen wipers to the low-speed setting. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_wipers3"
	val[]: "Now the wipers are working at a consistent speed to clear the rain.<font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Press @@imv_nrm_wipers@@ once more to set the high-speed setting. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_wipers_off"
	val[]: "You can see the wipers are working much faster now to clear the windscreen for maximum visibility. <font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Press @@imv_nrm_wipers@@ to turn the wipers off. </font>@@aca_goal_tip@@ You can also use the @@o_im_wipers_back@@ function to cycle backwards through the wipers speed settings. Check the Options Screen - '@@options_bindings_screen@@' - to see and/or change corresponding controls."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_wipers_off_back"
	val[]: "You can see the wipers are working much faster now to clear the windscreen for maximum visibility. <font face=/font/big_bold.font><br><br>Press @@imv_nrm_wipersback@@ multiple times until wipers are turned off. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_1_05_end"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Turn off the lights and shut down the engine. </font>"
#@}

#+ Book 1 Scenario 2_01
#@{

#### 2_01 common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_2_01_title"
	val[]: "Slalom Between the Cones"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_2_01_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll learn how to manoeuvre the truck around some traffic cones with the help of the mirrors."

#### 2_01 goal

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_01_summary"
	val[]: "Following Instructions"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_01_mirror"
	val[]: "Checking Mirrors"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_01_start"
	val[]: "Getting Started"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_01_steering"
	val[]: "Steering the Truck"



	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_01_check1"
	val[]: "Entering the Slalom"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_01_check2"
	val[]: "Avoiding the Traffic Cones"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_01_check_all"
	val[]: "Zigzagging Between the Traffic Cones"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_01_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_1_03_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_01_forward"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_1_03_forward@@"

#!}
	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_01_end"
	val[]: "Securing the Vehicle"

#### 2_01 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_cutscene1"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll take the tractor unit for a short drive through a slalom made of traffic cones."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Drive carefully and be aware of your surroundings. Keep an eye on both sides of the truck, and be sure to use the mirrors to help you navigate the course."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_cutscene3"
	val[]: "The course gets tighter towards the end, so precision is key."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_cutscene4"
	val[]: "Park in the designated area and secure the truck."

#### 2_01 Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_summary"
	val[]: "To complete this scenario, you must drive around all the cones without hitting any of them. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Press @@imv_nrm_activate@@ to confirm. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_mirror"
	val[]: "Use your mirrors to help maintain visibility down both sides of the truck.<br><br>For the passenger's side, the front and side mirrors can be very helpful in orienting yourself.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Press @@imv_nrm_activate@@ to confirm.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_start"
	val[]: "Adjust your mirrors, if necessary, in '@@adjust_link_t@@' (Access it via the pause menu).<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Prepare to set off. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_start_fail"
	val[]: "The truck still isn't ready to move, maybe you've forgotten something?<br><br>Is the engine on? Have you released the parking brake?"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_forward"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Proceed forwards slowly, and drive through the slalom. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_check2"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue around the cones. Pay special attention to the passenger's side.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_check_all"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue to zig and zag your way through the slalom without hitting any cones. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_stop"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Stop in the designated area. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_01_end"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Secure the truck and shut down the engine. </font>"
#@}

# Scenario 2_02 formatting
#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_check3_img"
	val[]: "<align vstyle=top hstyle=center><img src=/material/ui/academy/book/book1/illustration/turning1_2_02.mat width=202 height=221 color=FFFFFFFF></align><offset vshift=221>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_check3_img_uk"
	val[]: "<align vstyle=top hstyle=center><img src=/material/ui/academy/book/book1/illustration/turning_gb_1_2_02.mat width=202 height=221 color=FFFFFFFF></align><offset vshift=221>"
#!}

#+ Book 1 Scenario 2_02
#@{

#### 2_02 common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_2_02_title"
	val[]: "Combined Driving Manoeuvres"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_2_02_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll combine your newly learned skills to negotiate a short but technical course that will involve reversing into a turn and managing a tight 90 degree corner."

#### 2_02 goal



	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_02_check2"
	val[]: "Reversing to the Driver's Side"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_02_check3"
	val[]: "90 Degree Turn"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_02_check4"
	val[]: "Completing the Turn"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_02_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_end@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_02_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_2_02_check1"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_1_03_forward@@"

#!}

#### 2_02 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_cutscene1"
	val[]: "In front of you, there is a barrier. Drive up to it and stop."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Behind the truck on the driver's side, there is another barrier. Reverse around the curve to it. The road markings can be used as a guide."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_cutscene3"
	val[]: "Directly ahead, there is a sharp 90 degree turn. Drive towards it."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_cutscene4"
	val[]: "We'll have to drive deep into the corner so that the rear wheels will clear the traffic cone on the inside corner.<br>Use your mirrors!"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_cutscene5"
	val[]: "Straighten out, drive towards the final barriers, then stop and secure the truck."

#### 2_02 Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_start"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Prepare to set off. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_start_fail"
	val[]: "The truck still isn't ready to move, maybe you've forgotten something?<br><br>Is the engine on? Have you released the parking brake?"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_check1"
	val[]: "Straight ahead of you is a marked spot just before the barrier.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive forwards and stop in the marked spot. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_check2"
	val[]: "Look behind you on the driver's side; You'll see another marked spot there. You'll have to combine reversing with turning at the same time.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Reverse around the curve and stop in the marked spot. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_check3"
	val[]: "The course continues ahead of you through a 90 degree turn.<br><br>Stay to the driver's side before the turn, drive deep into the corner and turn quickly and sharply. Be sure not to hit the inside traffic cone.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive forwards and make the turn. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_check4"
	val[]: "Use your front and side mirrors to ensure you don't hit anything.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Complete the turn and stop in the designated area. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_2_02_end"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Shut down the engine and secure the truck.</font>"
#@}

