#+ Book 1 Scenario 3_05
#@{

#### 3_05 common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_05_title"
	val[]: "Reversing with a Trailer"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_05_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you'll try your hand at reversing with a trailer for the first time. It is a fairly simple manoeuvre, but you'll still need to steer correctly to put the trailer into the correct position."

	#### 3_05 goal



	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_05_check_con"
	val[]: "Reversing Towards the Trailer"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_05_connect"
	val[]: "Connecting the Trailer"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_05_park_br_off"
	val[]: "Releasing the Parking Brake"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_05_b_trailer"
	val[]: "Reversing with the Trailer"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_05_check1"
	val[]: "Continuing Towards the Parking Spot"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_05_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_1_03_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_05_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_end@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_05_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_05_backward"
	val[]: "@@aca_scenario_book1_1_04_title@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_05_park_br_on"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_1_03_park_br_on@@"

 #!}

#### 3_05 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene01"
	val[]: "Let's try our hand at reversing with a trailer. It's easier than it looks; you just need to be patient."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene02"
	val[]: "Start reversing and get the tractor in line with the trailer."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene03"
	val[]: "Be sure you're lined up properly, or you won't be able to make the connection. If it's not right, you can always pull forwards and try again."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene04"
	val[]: "The tractor's fifth wheel will lock onto the trailer's kingpin."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene05"
	val[]: "Apply the parking brake and connect the trailer. In real life, you'd have to exit the truck to connect the air and electrical lines and raise the landing gear, but here, we'll do that for you."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene06"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene06_img@@<br>The trailer will always turn <color value=@@clr_sel@@>opposite <color value=@@clr_txt@@>to the tractor."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene07"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene07_img@@<br>To turn the trailer, you'll need to steer the tractor in the<color value=@@clr_sel@@> opposite <color value=@@clr_txt@@> direction you want the trailer to go towards."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene08"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene08_img@@<br>To straighten out trailer again, turn the tractor <br><color value=@@clr_sel@@>towards<color value=@@clr_txt@@> the trailer."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene09"
	val[]: "Try to stay aligned with the trailer - you'll have to make constant minor corrections to keep the trailer pointed towards the marked area."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene10"
	val[]: "Correct deviations from your path with small turns of the steering wheel as soon as they happen. If you over steer it, you can end up far outside your desired path."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_cutscene11"
	val[]: "Stop in the designated area. Secure the truck and shut down the engine."

#### 3_05 Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_start"
	val[]: "Behind you and to the passenger's side, you will see a trailer. Your first task will be to reverse to it.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Prepare the truck to reverse. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_backward"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Begin reversing towards the trailer. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_check_con"
	val[]: "Align yourself in such a way that you are straight with the trailer. The fifth wheel needs to catch the kingpin. Pull forwards to adjust if necessary.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue reversing until you feel a connection. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_park_br_on"
	val[]: "The fifth wheel has coupled to the kingpin, and you're ready to finish coupling to the trailer.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Apply the parking brake. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_connect"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font> Press @@imv_nrm_attach@@ to connect the trailer. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_park_br_off"
	val[]: "Now the trailer is securely connected to the tractor, the air and electrical lines are connected, and the landing gear has been raised.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Release the parking brake. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_b_trailer"
	val[]: "You must reverse into the parking spot directly behind you. Remember that the trailer will turn in the opposite direction to how you steer the tractor. A small turn of the steering wheel can result in significant movement of the trailer.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Start reversing the trailer. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_check1"
	val[]: "Don't oversteer, just try to keep the trailer lined up with the spot. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Continue towards the parking spot. </font>"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_05_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_msg_book1_2_01_end@@"

#!}
#@}

#+ Book 1 Scenario 3_06
#@{

#### 3_06 common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_06_title"
	val[]: "Parking in a Narrow Space"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book1_3_06_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we'll park in a narrow space.<br><br>You'll have to manoeuvre the trailer to line up straight with an offset parking spot."

#### 3_06 goal


	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_06_check1"
	val[]: "Manoeuvring into Place"
#!{
	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_06_stop"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_1_03_stop@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_06_end"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_end@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_06_start"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_2_01_start@@"

	key[]: "aca_goal_book1_3_06_forward"
	val[]: "@@aca_goal_book1_3_02_forward@@"

 #!}
#### 3_06 msg - intro text

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_cutscene01"
	val[]: "Parking while driving forwards, or 'nosing in', is pretty easy as far as parking manoeuvres are concerned. <br>You will still need to compensate for the offset tracking of the trailer."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_cutscene02"
	val[]: "You'll have to drive past the point where you would normally turn the tractor by itself. This will allow you to get the trailer lined up more effectively."

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_cutscene03"
	val[]: "As you approach the parking spot, turn in to get the tractor in front of the trailer. Get lined up and proceed into the spot. <br>Stop, park, and secure the truck and shut down the engine."

#### 3_06 Driving Instructions

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_start"
	val[]: "Ahead of you there is a parking spot that you'll need to drive to and park inside of.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Prepare to set off. </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_forward"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Start driving and turn towards the parking spot.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_check1"
	val[]: "Drive past the parking spot to get your trailer lined up with the marked area, then bring the tractor into the spot and straighten out.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Park in the designated area.  </font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_stop"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Stop in the designated area.</font>"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book1_3_06_end"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Secure the truck and shut down the engine.</font>"
#@}

