#+ Book 2 intro
#@{

#### common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_intro_title"
	val[]: "Truck Driving Proficiency"

#### intro text

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_book2_intro_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Welcome back to @@driving_academy@@!"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_book2_intro_cutscene2"
	val[]: "The following scenarios represent the next step on your journey to professional truck driving."

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_book2_intro_cutscene3"
	val[]: "We won't be guiding you through each task this time around, so it's up to you to put your skill and experience to work."

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_book2_intro_cutscene4"
	val[]: "You may encounter some familiar manoeuvres, but this time in new environments made to look more like real world scenarios."

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_book2_intro_cutscene5"
	val[]: "New for @@driving_academy@@ is the addition of \"Pass\" and \"Bonus\" conditions."

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_book2_intro_cutscene6"
	val[]: "Like before, you must still complete each scenario without hitting anything, by parking successfully, and securing the truck..."

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_book2_intro_cutscene7"
	val[]: "...but now you must also do so in the allotted time limit, and with a limit in the number of direction changes between forward and reverse driving."

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_book2_intro_cutscene8"
	val[]: "Bonus conditions can be met by completing each scenario with even more challenging conditions..."

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_book2_intro_cutscene9"
	val[]: "...such as stricter time limits, fewer direction changes, and using the interior camera exclusively."

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_book2_intro_cutscene10"
	val[]: "By completing all scenarios, you may consider yourself a proficient trucker and ready for the next challenge down the road.<br><br>To further challenge yourself, complete all of the bonus conditions for each scenario; then you'll truly be a truck driving star!"

#@}


#+ Book 2 zero
#@{
#### zero common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_zero_title"
	val[]: "Tutorial"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_zero_desc"
	val[]: "In this tutorial scenario, we will help you to become acquainted with the new features found in Truck Driving Proficiency."

#### zero info msg1

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero1_title"
	val[]: "Truck Driving Proficiency"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero1"
	val[]: "At the start of each scenario, you will see a <color value=@@clr_sel@@>\"Scenario Briefing\"<color value=@@clr_txt@@> window. This will give you the information about the new Pass and Bonus conditions for the scenario. <br><br>Pass conditions must be met to complete the scenario successfully, while Bonus conditions are an optional extra challenge for those experienced and skilled players. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>To continue, turn on the ignition.</font>"

#### zero info msg1b

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero1b"
	val[]: "One of the bonus conditions requires you to complete the scenario while using the <color value=@@clr_sel@@>Interior Camera<color value=@@clr_txt@@>. You may still use the exterior cameras to check your surroundings, but only while the truck is stopped.<br><br>You can look around now to get your bearings, then switch back to the interior camera.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Switch to chase camera to check surroundings</font>"


#### zero info msg1c


	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero1c"
	val[]: "Get your bearings, then switch back to the interior camera.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Look around the truck</font>"


#### zero info msg1d


	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero1d"
	val[]: "<font face=/font/big_bold.font>Switch back to interior camera</font>"
#### zero info msg2

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero2_title"
	val[]: "Truck Driving Proficiency"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero2"
	val[]: "<color value=@@clr_sel@@>Time<color value=@@clr_txt@@> will also be a factor in Truck Driving Proficiency. All scenarios will have an individual time limit in which the scenario must be completed as a Pass condition, and many will also have an additional, stricter limit as a Bonus condition.<br><br>The timer starts only after the truck is moved.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Start the engine on and release the parking brake to continue.</font>"


#### zero info msg3

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero3_title"
	val[]: "Truck Driving Proficiency"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero3"
	val[]: "Another new addition for Truck Driving Proficiency is waypoints. All waypoints must be reached before a scenario can be completed. <br><br>Additionally, waypoints are sensitive to which direction the truck is facing as the waypoint is reached, so pay attention to any ground markings near the waypoint to orient yourself correctly.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive forwards to the waypoint in front of you.</font>"


#### zero info msg4

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero4_title"
	val[]: "Truck Driving Proficiency"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero4"
	val[]: "You've reached the waypoint, and can now move on to the next step. <br><br>There is another waypoint behind you that you must reverse into. Notice the arrow on the ground indicating which way the truck should be facing as you reach the waypoint. <br><br>Another Pass and Bonus condition that must be considered is <color value=@@clr_sel@@>Direction Changes<color value=@@clr_txt@@>. We count how many times you change direction between driving forward and reversing. Stay under the limit to complete the condition.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Reverse to the waypoint and stop.</font>"

#### zero info msg5

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero5_title"
	val[]: "Truck Driving Proficiency"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero5"
	val[]: "So by now, you should have accumulated one direction change. <br><br>Pick-up the trailer behind you to continue to the next step. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Reverse under the trailer in order to connect it.</font>"

#### zero info msg6

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero6_title"
	val[]: "Truck Driving Proficiency"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero6"
	val[]: "The final parking area is to your right. Some scenarios may have only one parking spot, while others will have multiple to choose from. Parking correctly in any one of the spots will allow you to complete the scenario. <br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font> Press @@imv_nrm_attach@@ to connect the trailer. </font>"


#### zero info msg7

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero7_title"
	val[]: "Truck Driving Proficiency"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero7"
	val[]: "The parking spots also indicate which way the truck should be oriented in the spot. Park in the wrong direction, and you will not be able to complete the scenario until correcting yourself, costing you time and direction changes.<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Drive to one of the parking spots and park correctly.</font>"



#### zero info msg8

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero8_title"
	val[]: "Truck Driving Proficiency"

	key[]: "aca_msg_book2_scenario_zero8"
	val[]: "You should now be familiar with the new parameters for Pass Conditions and Bonus Goals, and be ready to tackle the new scenarios in Truck Driving Proficiency!<br><br><font face=/font/big_bold.font>Secure the truck by applying the parking brake and turning off the engine to complete the scenario.</font>"



#@}



#+ Book 2 shortcut_backing
#@{
#### common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_shortcut_backing_title"
	val[]: "Shortcut"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_shortcut_backing_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you will attempt to use a shortcut which, unfortunately, is blocked at the end. You must then reverse back down the way you came."

#### intro text

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_shortcut_backing_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Drive to the waypoint up at the top of the hill and then reverse the same way back down. <br><br>Once back on the road, drive to the final parking area."



#@}

#+ Book 2 early_bird
#@{
#### common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_early_bird_title"
	val[]: "Early Bird"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_early_bird_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you must negotiate your way through an overcrowded lot. Space is extremely limited, so try to plan your moves in advance."

#### intro text

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_early_bird_cutscene1"
	val[]: "There are times when parking is so limited, other drivers will park wherever they can throughout the night. This can make it quite difficult to manoeuvre around them in the morning.<br><br> Do your best to make your way through the lot to the final parking spot."



#@}

#+ Book 2 driving_course
#@{
#### common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_driving_course_title"
	val[]: "Twisted"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_driving_course_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, you are tasked with driving through a very complex training course. Along the way, you must find and connect to a trailer, then bring it with you to the end."

#### intro text

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_driving_course_cutscene1"
	val[]: "This scenario will test your spacial and situational awareness. The course ahead is full of obstacles which you will not always be able to easily spot."

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_driving_course_cutscene2"
	val[]: "Make your way through the course to the trailer. Once you've located it, connect to it and pull it to the final parking spot."



#@}

#+ Book 2 vertigo
#@{
#### common
	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_vertigo_title"
	val[]: "Vertigo"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_vertigo_desc"
	val[]: "In this scenario, we will put your handling skills to the test. Drive around and around until you've reached the end!"

#### intro text

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_vertigo_cutscene1"
	val[]: "Time to put your truck handling skills to the test; this track has been designed to see how well you know your truck!"

	key[]: "aca_scenario_book2_vertigo_cutscene2"
	val[]: "The centrepiece is a long spiral, which will test your ability to handle the truck through long sweeping curves."

#@}




